      </div>

      <div class="small">
        Use something you learned in a real situation.
      </div>

      <div class="quest-meta">

        <span class="xp">+25 XP</span>

        <button onclick="completeQuest('apply',25)">
          Complete
        </button>

      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="quest">

      <div class="quest-title">
        📝 Reflect
